  "bounds": {
    "domain": "One owner-confirmed reference, one identity read and at most one conditional delete. One same-id foreign transport row remains outside the target. Two thread/date equality classes and two raw-date representations cover replacement and normalization races. Owner confirmation and trustworthy platform affected-row counts are assumptions. Actual SQLite predicates and bridge guards are exercised by JVM cases; real Telephony permission/AppOp/role enforcement, Binder reliability, process death, carrier behavior and physical-device acceptance remain separate. Lost or invalid replies are unknown and grant no retry.",
    "conformance": "Whole production Java over an in-memory SQLite ContentProvider, plus actual bridge entry/lifecycle fencing. No radio or real device data is touched."
  },
